<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 23.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 23.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 23     July 22   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  285.420     283.610     247.020   15.55 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.410     309.520     306.830    0.84 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.080     156.500     158.970   -1.82 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.310	46.404	47.182   -1.85 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  479.980     474.840     419.180   14.50 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.620     139.025     141.685   -2.16 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.064	16.085	16.185   -0.75 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  247.530     244.050     212.430   16.52 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.855	 1.859	 1.888   -1.75 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.547	 1.551	 1.581   -2.15 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  192.470     190.845     183.135    5.10 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate. -- Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
